@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+- (a1) helpers/validation: NO fragment file (a macro that emits attributes can't be a fragment). Model attribute `ValidationErrors validationErrors` (import de.deadlocker8.budgetmaster.view.ValidationErrors; set automatically from the controller's "error" BindingResult by ValidationErrorsInterceptor; null when none). `<@validation.validation "name" "x"/>` -> on the element: `t:class="validation.classes(validationErrors, 'name', 'x')" t:data-position="validation.position(validationErrors, 'name')" t:data-delay="validation.delay(validationErrors, 'name')" t:data-tooltip="validation.tooltip(validationErrors, 'name')"` (pass '' for no classes; remove any static class attr).
+- (a1) categories/categoriesFunctions: function `categories.name(category)` (= getCategoryName); fragments `categoryCircle(PageContext page, Category category, String classes, boolean datasetValue, boolean enableSearchWrapper)` (defaults '', false, false), `modalIconSelect` (no args).
+
+## a3: helpers/iconSelect.html, helpers/fontColorPicker.html
+- `~{helpers/iconSelect :: iconSelect(PageContext page, String id, Icon icon, String fontColor, String color, String name, boolean showBackground, String initialBackgroundClasses, String backgroundClasses, boolean preventFallbackIcon)}`
+  item is passed as parts: icon=`item.iconReference`, fontColor=`view.fontColor(item, page.darkTheme)`, color=`item.color` (`''` if none), name=`item.name` (`''` if irrelevant).
+  FreeMarker defaults: showBackground=true, initialBackgroundClasses='', backgroundClasses='', preventFallbackIcon=false.
+  e.g. template: `iconSelect(page, 'template-icon', template.iconReference, view.fontColor(template, page.darkTheme), '', '', false, '', '', true)`
+- `~{helpers/iconSelect :: modalIconSelect(String idToFocusOnClose, Icon icon, List<String> fontawesomeIcons)}` (fontawesomeIcons = model attribute; declare `List<String> fontawesomeIcons` in t:params)
+- `~{helpers/fontColorPicker :: fontColorPicker(String fontColor, String defaultFontColor)}`: `fontColorPicker(view.fontColor(template, page.darkTheme), icons.defaultFontColor(template, page.darkTheme))`
+- function namespace `icons` (view/IconSelectFunctions): `icons.defaultFontColor(item, dark)`, `icons.validImageUploadTypes()`, `icons.hint(key)`.
+- (a1) helpers/customSelectMacros (all macros; pass every arg, defaults in comments): `customCategorySelect(PageContext page, List<Category> categories, Category selectedCategory, String inputClasses, String labelText, String id, boolean showName, String rowClasses, boolean disabled, String form)`; `customAccountSelect(PageContext page, String selector, String inputName, List<Account> accounts, Account selectedAccount, String inputClasses, String labelText, String id, boolean disabled)`; `customAccountStateSelect(String selector, String inputName, List<AccountState> availableStates, AccountState selectedState, String inputClasses, String labelText, String id)`; `globalAccountSelect(PageContext page, Account currentAccount, List<Account> readableAccounts)`; `customSelectCategoryOption(PageContext page, Category category, boolean isSelected)`; `customSelectOptionCategoryContent(PageContext page, Category category, String classes, boolean datasetValue, boolean showName)`; `customSelectAccountOption(PageContext page, Account account, boolean isSelected)`; `customSelectOptionAccountContent(PageContext page, Account account, String classes)`; `customSelectAccountStateOption(AccountState state, boolean isSelected)`; `customSelectOptionAccountStateContent(AccountState state, String classes)`; `accountIcon` unchanged. Also function `enums.name(anyEnum)` (= x.name(), for enums overriding toString).
+- (a1) helpers/globalDatePicker: `datePicker(LocalDate currentDate, String target, List<String> monthNames)` (pass currentDate, '/reports', localizedMonthNames); `datePickerLocalization(List<String> localizedMonthNames, List<String> localizedWeekdays)` (renders the <script>; declare both model attrs in t:params).
+
+## transactions/newTransactionMacros.html (owner a2)
+Functions: namespace `transactionView` (view/TransactionViewFunctions.java): nameSuggestions(), amountString(Integer), currencyString(Integer),
+longDate(LocalDate), simpleDatepicker(), hint(key), currentAccountOrDefault(), decimalSeparator(), groupingSeparator(), ...
+`validationErrors` = a1's ValidationErrors model attribute (may be null). Every argument is required.
+- `isExpenditureSwitch(Boolean isExpenditure)`                       e.g. (template.isExpenditure())
+- `transactionName(String name, List<String> nameSuggestions, ValidationErrors validationErrors)`
+     nameSuggestions: model attribute "nameSuggestions" (set by TransactionService.prepareModelNewOrEdit) or transactionView.nameSuggestions()
+- `insertNameSuggestions(List<String> nameSuggestions)`
+- `transactionAmount(Integer amount, ValidationErrors validationErrors)`
+- `transactionStartDate(LocalDate date, LocalDate currentDate)`
+- `transactionDescription(String description, ValidationErrors validationErrors)`
+- `transactionTags(List<Tag> tags)`
+- `transactionRepeating(Transaction transaction, LocalDate currentDate, ValidationErrors validationErrors)`
+- `buttons(String cancelURL, boolean includeContinueButton, boolean allowEmptyAmount, boolean csvImportActive)`
+     csvImportActive replaces the session attribute currentCsvTransaction?? (pass false if your page can't be in a CSV import)
+- `buttonTransactionActions(boolean canChangeType, boolean canCreateTemplate, boolean changeTypeInProgress, Integer transactionId)`
